---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
<div class="page-layout">
<div class="profile-container">
<div class="profile-content">
<div class="profile-header">
<h1>AJ Shanahan</h1>
<div class="profile-photo-wrap">
<img src="/AJpic.webp" alt="AJ Shanahan" class="profile-photo">
</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>About</h2>
<p>
Mr. Shanahan is a recent graduate of Washington University in Saint Louis with a Master's degree in Aerospace Engineering. In addition to his masters, he holds a Bachelor's of Science in Mechanical Engineering, and a Bachelor's of Arts in Physics. His work spans the design and construction of scientific instrumentation, including an open-source fluorescent microscope and an autonomous rover. Most recently, he has been working on developing a unified concept for a self-coating space telescope by integrating multiple Phase II SBIR–funded technologies matured over more than 25 years. For this effort, he developed the 3D design, produced animations, and built the interactive telescope design interface for ZeCoat's website.
</p>
</div>

<hr>

<div class="section">
<h2>Education</h2>
<ul class="education-list">
<li><strong>B.A Physics and Religious Studies</strong>, Lawrence University, WI, May 2025</li>
<li><strong>B.S Mechanical Engineering</strong>, Washington University in Saint Louis, MO, May 2025</li>
<li><strong>M.S. Aerospace Engineering</strong>, Washington University in Saint Louis, MO, December 2025</li>
</ul>
</div>

<hr>

<div class="section">
<h2>Engineering Experience</h2>
<ul class="experience-list">
<li><strong>ZeCoat Corporation – Engineer</strong>, Present - 2025</li>
<li><strong>Developed Replication of an Ancient Astrolabe</strong> - Senior Project: 2023</li>
<li><strong>Building Open-Source Microscope</strong> - Research Assistant: 2022</li>
<li><strong>Assembly of Autonomous Rover</strong> - Senior Project: 2022</li>
</ul>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.page-layout {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    min-height: 100vh;
}

.profile-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 800px;
}

.profile-content {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.06);
}

.profile-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
}

/* Two equal halves: the name is centered in the left half,
   the photo is centered in the right half. */
.profile-header > h1,
.profile-photo-wrap {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-width: 0;
}

.profile-header > h1 {
    text-align: center;
}

.profile-photo-wrap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
}

.profile-photo {
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 3px solid #E2E8F0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.1);
}

.profile-content h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #16202E;
    margin: 0;
}

.section {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #16202E;
    margin: 0 0 15px 0;
}

.section p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #475569;
    margin: 0;
}

.education-list,
.experience-list {
    list-style-position: inside;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin: 0;
}

.education-list li,
.experience-list li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #475569;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.education-list li:last-child,
.experience-list li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
}

.education-list strong,
.experience-list strong {
    color: #16202E;
}

hr {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    margin: 30px 0;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
    .profile-content {
        padding: 24px;
    }

    .profile-photo {
        width: 150px;
        height: 150px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .profile-content h1 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    .section h2 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .section p,
    .education-list li,
    .experience-list li {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
}
</style>
